<h1
  style='margin:0 0 16px;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:24px;color:#8D153A;'
>Booking confirmed</h1>
<p style='margin:0 0 16px;line-height:1.6;'>Hi {{name}},</p>
<p style='margin:0 0 16px;line-height:1.6;'>Good news — your booking
  <strong>{{bookingId}}</strong>
  is confirmed. We look forward to seeing you at pickup.</p>
<p style='margin:0 0 8px;line-height:1.6;'><strong>Vehicle:</strong>
  {{vehicleName}}</p>
<p style='margin:0 0 8px;line-height:1.6;'><strong>Dates:</strong>
  {{pickupDate}} → {{returnDate}}</p>
<p style='margin:0 0 8px;line-height:1.6;'><strong>Pickup:</strong>
  {{pickupLocation}}</p>
<p style='margin:0 0 24px;line-height:1.6;'><strong>Total:</strong>
  {{totalAmount}}</p>
<p style='margin:0 0 28px;'>
  <a
    href='{{{bookingUrl}}}'
    style='display:inline-block;background:#EF971A;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 28px;font-weight:600;'
  >View booking</a>
</p>
<p style='margin:0;line-height:1.6;font-size:13px;color:#666;'>Please bring a
  valid ID and driving licence at pickup.</p>
